[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `#if`, and comparison operators in `src/driver.c` yields **zero** matches (see
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `ERRORS.md`). There is no global state, no init function, no setter, no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m environment-variable read, no compile-time option in `CMakeLists.txt` beyond
