[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Control flow that does branch:** exactly one construct, the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `for (int i = 0; i < len; i++)` loop in `print_hex`, with `len` fixed at `4`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m It therefore always executes exactly 4 iterations followed by one `printf("\n")`.
