[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    normalisation) while passing the argument across the FFI boundary.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 4. **Sign bit** — top bit of the last (highest-address) byte on little-endian.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
