[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    337[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // `return`, no `assert`, no range check, no null check, no error enum). These
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    338[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // tests therefore cover the generic boundaries every C API has, asserting the
