[38;5;252m[1m## Notable design points[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Both [38;5;10m.so[0ms print through the [3msame[23m process-wide libc [38;5;10mstdout[0m, so capture had to happen at the file-descriptor level ([38;5;10mdup2[0m fd 1 → scratch file or pipe, [38;5;10mfflush(NULL)[0m, restore). That made the suite incompatible with libtest's parallel runner, whose own [38;5;10mtest foo ... ok[0m progress lines leaked into the capture window — visible as a bogus divergence. Fixed with [38;5;10m.cargo/config.toml[0m setting [38;5;10mRUST_TEST_THREADS = "1"[0m, so plain [38;5;10mcargo test[0m is correct without special flags.[0m[0m
